  description="Terms of use for the Healthy website and waitlist."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 5 September 2026</p>

    <p>
      These terms govern your use of the Healthy marketing website and waitlist. This is a placeholder
      agreement for early access. We will update it before launch.
    </p>

    <h2>Acceptance</h2>
    <p>
      By using this site or submitting your email to the waitlist, you agree to these terms and our
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Waitlist</h2>
    <p>
      Joining the waitlist does not guarantee access, pricing, or availability. We may modify or
      discontinue early access at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about these terms can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:legal@gethealthyapp.com">legal@gethealthyapp.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
